(26, 'aura-cross-line-set', 'Aura Cross-Line Set ', 'Step into your day with confidence and style in our Aura Cross-Line Wired Set. Perfectly tailored for teenage girls who want a mix of trendy fashion and gentle support, this crisp white set features a lightweight wired bra that contours naturally without feeling heavy. Styled with breathable sheer mesh panels and cute geometric cross-lines, it adds a playful, modern touch to your top drawer. Complete with matching mid-rise panties that are soft against the skin, it’s your go-to choice for school, college, or weekend hangouts.', '', 1500.00, 2000.00, 18, 28, 'SALE, BESTSELLER, TRENDING, ESSENTIAL', '[\"28\",\"30\",\"32\",\"34\"]', '[{\"name\":\"White\",\"hex\":\"#ffffff\",\"images\":[\"https:\\/\\/res.cloudinary.com\\/dcdogxx8v\\/image\\/upload\\/v1778935906\\/products\\/gvw7kcyr5gjfp9oncmiv.jpg\",\"https:\\/\\/res.cloudinary.com\\/dcdogxx8v\\/image\\/upload\\/v1778935906\\/products\\/faryivalcsqiaalvweuj.jpg\",\"https:\\/\\/res.cloudinary.com\\/dcdogxx8v\\/image\\/upload\\/v1778935906\\/products\\/mbgcnqfjdgbmki7mvccv.jpg\"]},{\"name\":\"Black\",\"hex\":\"#000000\",\"images\":[\"https:\\/\\/res.cloudinary.com\\/dcdogxx8v\\/image\\/upload\\/v1778935906\\/products\\/w04olbnsb9dofqb1eyx2.jpg\",\"https:\\/\\/res.cloudinary.com\\/dcdogxx8v\\/image\\/upload\\/v1778935906\\/products\\/kmptgjuycvdkmvb2jtq0.jpg\",\"https:\\/\\/res.cloudinary.com\\/dcdogxx8v\\/image\\/upload\\/v1778935906\\/products\\/t4ig0g6mpkagjbc26jj1.jpg\",\"https:\\/\\/res.cloudinary.com\\/dcdogxx8v\\/image\\/upload\\/v1778935906\\/products\\/bc9u1qjbm1e7lej22xkc.jpg\"]},{\"name\":\"Wine Red\",\"hex\":\"#802a43\",\"images\":[\"https:\\/\\/res.cloudinary.com\\/dcdogxx8v\\/image\\/upload\\/v1778935906\\/products\\/rpdhjp2a62zc5pvo9gbb.jpg\",\"https:\\/\\/res.cloudinary.com\\/dcdogxx8v\\/image\\/upload\\/v1778935906\\/products\\/wxlgfthehpjtotejrs2x.jpg\"]}]', '2026-05-16 12:51:48', 5, '[{\"color\":\"White\",\"colorHex\":\"#ffffff\",\"images\":[\"https:\